# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Milestone 1 — Eureka Server
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The Eureka Server introduced in this milestone requires NO environment
# variables. It runs out of the box using
# backend/eureka-server/src/main/resources/application.yml.
#
# There is currently nothing to configure in this file.
